# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
*.pixelover
*.crocotile
*.glb

# .import sidecars are meant to be committed: they hold each asset's UID, and
# without them a fresh clone re-imports with new UIDs and every ext_resource
# reference into that asset breaks.

# Scratch space for art experiments. Work in progress here got swept into
# unrelated commits more than once by a `git add -A`; ignoring it means that
# cannot happen by accident, whoever or whatever is doing the staging.
# To commit something from here, move it out of _tests/ first.
assets/sprites/characters/_tests/

# Python bytecode from the sprite-generation tools. Regenerated on every run and
# machine-specific, so it has no business in the history.
__pycache__/
